152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (OrbitalNet OS is a distributed middleware architecture designed to transform satellite operations from manual, ground-based scripting to autonomous, on-orbit coordination. As satellite constellations scale from tens to thousands, traditional centralized control becomes a bottleneck. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (This project introduces a physics-native operating system that treats the entire fleet as a single computing entity. By embedding orbital mechanics directly into the kernel scheduler and utilizing Delay-Tolerant Networking \(DTN\), the system enables satellites to autonomously allocate tasks, predict connectivity gaps, and self-heal during communication blackouts. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
