157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (OrbitalNet OS is a distributed mission coordination framework for satellite fleets. Instead of treating satellites as isolated hardware units controlled individually from Earth, it abstracts the fleet into a collaborative "swarm." The system autonomously assigns tasks, optimizes resource usage, and adapts to real-time physics constraints \(like eclipses or link loss\) without human intervention.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (Current space operations rely on "Scripted Control." Operators manually schedule every action for every satellite.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
