163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (We are entering the era of Mega-Constellations \(e.g., Starlink, Planet\). Managing 1,000+ satellites manually is mathematically impossible. The industry urgently needs software that decouples fleet size from operational overhead, allowing linear fleet growth with constant staff size.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
