<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 508 0 R
/E (Researchers are developing fully distributed scheduling, onboard autonomy architectures \(MAPE-K\), AI-enabled mission planning, and multi-agent satellite swarms.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
